        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SOLID PHASE (~50% by volume):\n    +------------------+\n    | MINERAL PARTICLES|\n    | 45% of total     |\n    | volume           |\n    +------------------+\n      Sand (2.0–0.05mm), Silt (0.05–0.002mm),\n      Clay (<0.002mm)\n      Originate from rock weathering"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SOIL-SCIENCE.md#005",
      "path": [
        "04-SOIL-SCIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
