        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Soil Science for Horticulture",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "+------------------+\n    | ORGANIC MATTER   |\n    | 5% of total      |\n    | volume           |\n    +------------------+\n      Fresh debris → humus → stabilized OM\n      Living: 1% (roots, organisms)\n      Non-living: 4% (decomposed material)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SOIL-SCIENCE.md#006",
      "path": [
        "04-SOIL-SCIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
