      "text": "KEY TEXTURE CLASSES:\n  Sandy: >70% sand — fast drainage, low water retention, low nutrients\n  Loam: balanced mix — \"ideal\"; good structure, drainage, and retention\n  Clay: >40% clay — slow drainage, high retention, shrink-swell, compacts\n  Silt: smooth texture; good water retention but poor structure; crusts\n```"
