        "title": "Soil Science for Horticulture",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Structure = the arrangement of particles into aggregates (peds). Unlike texture, structure can be managed."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SOIL-SCIENCE.md#021",
      "path": [
        "04-SOIL-SCIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
