        "id": "maxim:horticulture:soil-science",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "horticulture",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[soil, science]",
        "section": "horticulture",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Soil Science for Horticulture",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MACROPORES (>0.075mm): drainage, gas exchange, root penetration\n  MESOPORES (0.0002–0.075mm): water storage (held against gravity)\n  MICROPORES (<0.0002mm): water held too tightly for plants (unavailable)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SOIL-SCIENCE.md#023",
      "path": [
