        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Soil Science for Horticulture",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STRUCTURE QUALITY INDICATORS:\n  Visual: crumbly, granular aggregates (good)\n          massive, compacted (bad)\n          slaking: aggregates that collapse in water (unstable)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SOIL-SCIENCE.md#024",
